WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.400
Everyone, go!

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:04.560
Barian's...

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:05.760
Chaos...

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.060
DRAW!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.870
What's with... those lights!?

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.250
I've never felt anything like...

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.560
... this incredible power before.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:29.800
Just what... ?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.650
What the...

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.530
Just what is...

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.950
IV, I told you...

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.170
I'd show you the abyss of Chaos.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:46.020
This is the real power of the Seven Emperors...

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:49.900
Rank-Up-Magic The Seventh One!

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:55.320
This card Ranks Up an Over-Hundred Number into a Chaos Number!

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:58.200
A Rank-Up to a Chaos Numbers you say!?

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:00.870
But your Number is in the Graveyard!

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.200
That's right...

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.400
But with this card, I can chose an Over-Hundred Numbers,

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.890
and summon it with it's monster effects negated!

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:11.470
What'd you say?!

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.470
From my graveyard,

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:17.900
I special summon Number 101 - Silent Honor's Ark Knight!

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.150
I overlay the Rank 4 Ark Knight!

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.670
And reconstruct the Overlay network with that monster!

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:32.120
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.150
Manifest before us, Chaos Numbers 107!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:41.800
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Tachyon Dragon!

00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:48.050
Appear, Chaos Numbers 106!

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:53.050
Giant Hand Red the Molten Fist!

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.500
Come, Chaos Numbers 105!

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:06.000
Burning Knuckler Comet Caestus!

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:11.270
Show yourself, Chaos Numbers 103!

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.770
Ragna Infinity, the God-Slaying Ice Maiden!

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:24.920
Come out, Chaos Numbers 102!

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:30.000
Unholy Lightning Noble Demon!

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:37.120
Appear, Chaos Numbers 101!

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:41.580
Insatiable Guardian of the Souls!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:45.450
Become the Dark Knight and crush the Light!

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:55.900
Silent Honor's Dark Knight!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:02.670
How's that?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.300
This is...

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.520
... the Abyss of Chaos that humans can never reach!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.500
What the-? That guy...

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:13.300
That gives me goose bumps by just looking at it.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.950
It's Ryouga's Chaos Number!

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:20.570
Now, IV. From here on, this is a Duel of Truth!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.310
{marker}

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:26.490
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:31.730
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:43.420
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:47.600
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:54.420
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:58.400
the feelings I want to express.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:07.420
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.670
Right now, with you

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:14.600
Oh - By facing each other,

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:21.680
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:26.780
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:32.210
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:37.380
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:46.960
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.600
Those are your...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:00.190
... Over-Hundred Chaos Numbers!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.740
<i>The Immortal Lancer, Silent Honor's Dark Knight!</i>

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.070
You've got some mood there, don't you?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.700
But despite that, we...

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.410
As it would be a disgrace...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.370
... and we can't afford to lose!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.790
Now, bring it!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.960
So <i>this</i> is Nasch's power...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:27.430
Who would have thought up to now that he's got such a huge power...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:33.560
On top, he affects the others of the seven Emperors too...

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.520
With this, there is no way these humans could win, even if they unite.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.360
But, Nasch...

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.400
... can you really fight against that guy you once called your friend?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.540
<i>Ryouga.</i>

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.420
So you came here again?

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.010
Don't call me that anymore.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.010
Oh right, you're now Nasch.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.350
Anger had burned to a war with only sorrows remaining,

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.900
and the souls laden with it have drifted to the Barian World.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.570
The one to made this happen was... me.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:23.770
That's wrong.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.400
It happened, because I could only answer with hatred towards hatred.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.570
It's a fate I caused!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:37.080
But, Nasch, are you going to have a fight against Yuma and the others to protect this world?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.630
Fight... There'll be a fight!

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.630
I am Nasch!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.000
Even though they have been my friends, but -

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.130
I have to bury all that!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.050
... For the Barian World!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.140
I activate the effect of Silent Honor's Dark Knight!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.890
Once per turn, Dark Knight can take one opposing monster,

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:02.940
and make it his own Chaos Overlay Unit!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.400
This time, you don't even need to use an Overlay Unit anymore?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:13.030
I change Gimmick Puppet Serial Killer into a Chaos Overlay Unit for Dark Knight!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.200
Dark Soul Over!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.300
IV, your nonsense ends here and now!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.420
Dark Knight attacks directly!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.680
Farewell, IV.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.810
What? That was too easy...

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:39.980
Not yet!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:45.860
I've decided I'll drag you back by all means!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.240
As you take your 'destiny' as something to be accepted,

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.320
I'll smash it with this duel!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.280
How did you...?

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.910
The moment I was hit by Dark Knight's attack...

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:04.500
I used the effect of my Gimmick Puppet - Shadow Feeler that was sent to the Graveyard.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:09.510
When my opponent attacks me directly, while Shadow Feeler is in the Graveyard...

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.550
I can special summon this monster in Attack Position.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.930
And then the attacking opponent's monster battles this card instead.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.600
But, the guy cannot be destroyed during this battle.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:25.980
I see. So instead of getting fatally hit by my direct attack,

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:30.320
with Shadow Feeler as a shield, some of your life was left.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.450
Not too bad.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.200
Then, I'll beat you to dust all the more.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.120
I end my turn with this!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.160
But I'm surprised,

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.460
that the cheating champion of East Asia actually got this far.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.080
Sure. That's why I am that popular.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:50.630
Anyway, but this duel is to revive our bonds with you!

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:52.130
Bonds...?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.170
What a kitsch.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.430
What?!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.600
I'm tired of that friendship-game with you guys!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:02.060
Ryouga! You seriously <i>mean</i> this?

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.890
Of <i>course</i>, I'm serious.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:07.270
<i>Bonds</i> and <i>Friendship</i>,

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:10.360
I never felt anything of that gooey crap!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.900
<i>Looks like this is good.</i>

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.950
<i>IV, hate me!</i>

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.280
<i>Instead of an old friend, I am an enemy to beat!</i>

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:23.080
Even if you say the bond our friendship between us is dead...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.960
I'm going to reforge them in this Duel!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.000
My turn! Draw!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.800
I activate the Equip Spell Card Overlay Satellite

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.710
and equip Shadow Feeler!

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:40.550
The equipped monster then is treated as two Xyz Materials!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:49.360
I overlay my Level 8 Shadow Feelers!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.690
I'll build the Overlay Network with this double monster!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.700
Xyz Summon!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.450
Appear, Numbers 40!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.740
Gimmick Puppet, Heaven's Strings!

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:09.290
And then Overlay Satellite becomes an Xyz Material for Heaven's Strings!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.840
However, the monster special summoned using this card's effect

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.170
cannot attack this turn.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.930
These precious 3000 ATK make no sense at all, if you can't attack.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:24.560
No matter how loud your voice is, your words won't resonate in my heart!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.140
If so, then shouldn't I make them resonate?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.020
Heaven's Strings' effect activates!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.520
Once per turn, I can have this monster

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.030
detach one Overlay Unit,

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.160
to place 1 String Counter on each opposing monster.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:43.910
Then the monsters with Heaven's String's String Counters on them

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.540
will be destroyed at the same time as the next turn ends!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.130
then their total original ATK will be inflicted on you as damage!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.630
When Shadow Feeler is sent to the Graveyard as an Xyz Material, it's banished.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:02.010
At this moment, I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Banish Reactor!

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.100
When one of my cards is banished,

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.020
I can return 1 card from my Graveyard to my hand!

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:12.230
To my hand, I return Argent Chaos Force!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.440
You took such a lot of time and effort, just to return that mockery of the power of Chaos to your hand?

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.030
This is the card that my big brother entrusted to me with.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.790
This is a card filled with the feelings of people I believe in!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.040
They should be with you as well!

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:32.670
All the feelings that have amassed through duels!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.380
Those words don't fit you at all.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.670
Sure! But Yuma,

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.840
and you, Ryouga, have changed me into a man who can say those words!

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:46.640
As I was changed by the duel, I will change you back again!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:53.060
I activate Rank-Up-Magic Argent Chaos Force!

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:58.360
This card Ranks Up an Xyz Monster,

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.700
special summoning a Chaos Xyz!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.280
I overlay my Rank 8 Heaven's Strings!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.080
And re-build the Overlay Network using this monster!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.660
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.040
Appear, Chaos Number 40!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:20.420
Fruit of humanity's wisdom, let the devil revive!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.130
Gimmick Puppet, Devil Strings!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.640
There's his new Chaos Number.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.270
Let's go, Ryouga!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.100
I activate Devil's Strings' effect!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:37.150
This monster destroys all Monsters with a string counter!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.270
What?!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.150
Melody Of Massacre!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:48.330
Then the total original ATK of the destroyed Monsters

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.580
will be inflicted to my opponent as damage!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.620
Alright, eat my feelings and come to your senses!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.840
<i>IV...</i>

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.640
<i>... these are your... feelings...</i>

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.520
Devil's Strings' other effect!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:19.190
When an opponent's monster is destroyed, I draw a card!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.530
<i>IV...</i>

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:27.160
<i>Is this... how strong your feelings towards me are?</i>

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.830
Ryouga...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.580
<i>If his form has come back,</i>

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.040
<i>with a little bit more, he should get back his heart too!</i>

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.630
Dark Knight's effect activates...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.260
When Dark Knight is destroyed while it has Chaos Overlay Units,

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.640
this monster is special summoned back to my field!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.100
Return From Limbo!

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:05.400
Then I regain Life Points equal to Dark Knight's Attack.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:16.290
<i>When it's gone, it stubbornly revives!</i>

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:20.330
But Dark Knight has no more Chaos Overlay Units!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.380
I have Devil's Strings attack Dark Knight!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:28.050
Trap activate! Overlay Connect!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.430
When there's a Xyz Monster on my field with no Overlay Units...

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.180
... this card will be it's Overlay Unit!

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.610
That guy's Chaos Overlay Unit is...

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.250
It seems my voice still hasn't reached you.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:15:01.750
With Devil's Strings' effect, I draw 1 card!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.260
Dark Knight can infinitely revive!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:11.050
Dark Knight's effect activates! Return From Limbo!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:20.350
Then I regain life equal to the revived Dark Knight's ATK!

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.400
5300 Life now...

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.280
As long as I am the guardian of Barian,

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:33.570
the great many of unsatisfied souls will lend me their powers!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:36.450
IV, therefore it would be reasonable to give up.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:41.120
No matter how often you make me suffer, your feelings won't reach my heart!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.830
No way! I won't give up!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.420
No matter how often you try recovering your life

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:50.760
Right now, your appearance without doubt is the Kamishiro Ryouga I know!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.890
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:58.020
My turn. Draw!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:02.270
I have my Dark Knight absorb Devil's Strings!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.310
Your vain hope is done in with that!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.870
Now IV's field is stripped.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.490
With the next direct attack, he'll go to hell.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.870
Trap activate! Panic Shuffle!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.750
When my Xyz-Monster has been targeted by an opponent's effect

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.300
all the monsters on the field are changed to defense position!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.640
Then, each player...

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:39.770
returns all the Magic- and trap cards from the graveyard to the deck and shuffles it!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.310
So you outsmarted that one.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.190
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.360
<i>You still are a damned bastard after all...</i>

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:52.190
<i>Though I dumped all the human from my heart,</i>

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:55.490
<i>your passion you threw at me still went in.</i>

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:59.620
<i>But I don't want any of your passionate feelings.</i>

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.580
<i>I want all and everything to be devoured...</i>

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.040
<i>by hatred!</i>

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.210
Let me show you something interesting now!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:18.050
Not yet... I can't fall yet here.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.390
Yuma, hold on, I will absolutely...

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:28.150
bring back the bonds between Rio-<i>san</i> and us!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.530
No matter how you try knocking me out,

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.450
for Yuma's sake I will get up again and again!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.870
Even if our bodies perish, the blades of our hearts will never shatter!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.790
Well said, Yamikawa!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.670
We'll hold on even if we die together!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:56.470
Justice... Justice can never lose.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:59.050
And love will always win!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.600
I'll protect Yuma no matter what!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.060
Now, come!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.900
This is...

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.580
He... here is...

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.200
Thank goodness, you woke up.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.750
Is everyone... safe?

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:30.750
Yuma...

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.420
They're fine... everyone's safe...

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.130
Really?

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:42.220
What will happen to your <i>precious</i> friends...?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.720
Shouldn't you rather worry about <i>them</i> with your feelings?

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.140
These guys are my fanservice for <i>you</i>!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.390
IV!

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.490
Farewell.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.780
Yuma, I'm sorry...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.750
I... would have wanted to offer you much more...

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.580
Now way, a hero of justice can't lose...

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:21.510
No matter what you do, everything is pointless before Giant Hand Red!

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.010
Let me have you crushed!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.480
I... I regret nothing.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.900
Yuma... My disciple, I can't watch you grow up,

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:39.490
please forgive me, your useless teacher...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.620
So hot, too hot, you bastard!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.040
If you like heat this much,

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:51.040
I'll burn down each of your cells in my fists!

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.460
That's some brutal mood...

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.970
Not only I couldn't pay back that Barian...

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.470
Yuma... I couldn't even pay back my debt to you.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.350
Woman, you have fought well.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.140
Now sleep well.

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:19.320
I couldn't even buy them some time, pathetic...

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.570
I acknowledge the feelings you showed me in this Duel...

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:30.410
But right now, they're nothing but a nuisance to me!

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.750
Dammit...

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:37.880
This is a Duel I had to win no matter what, for Yuma's sake.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:42.800
I should have come back to Yuma with Rio-<i>san</i> by my side...

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.760
And yet, I...

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.570
How's that, IV?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:03.490
Your friends have been killed one by one.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.990
Helpless against the overwhelming force, their bodies were crushed down.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.700
What's up? It's <i>your</i> turn next.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.210
Or did that right now break your heart?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:24.130
That low... That you damn let yourself fall that low.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.930
To let yourself become such a decrepit demon, that your heart is beyond bringing back!?

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.890
<i>That's right. Very good. IV...</i>

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.310
<i>Hate me as a Barian.</i>

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.690
<i>Use the death of your friends to inflame and fuel your hatred against me.</i>

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.110
<i>By defeating you like that,</i>

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:46.110
<i>I can bury all of my life as Kamishiro Ryouga...</i>

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.320
Ryouga... no...

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.660
You bastard aren't Ryouga anymore!

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.910
That's right. I am Nasch!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:56.290
I am Nasch of the Barians!

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.540
Come, IV...

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.590
Soon, you'll join the rest of your friends in hell!

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.230
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.190
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:38.080
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.300
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:49.220
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:54.560
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.350
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.280
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.440
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:11.820
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.700
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.450
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.920
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.040
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:26.880
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.300
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:42.850
As the friends have died one after another,

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:46.860
the grief hidden inside IV turns him even more fierce!

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.950
Then, the draw with everything they've got will decide their destinies!

00:23:51.360 --> 00:23:52.910
You are awake, Yuma.

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:54.990
What do you mean with that?

00:23:55.080 --> 00:23:57.490
Yuma, I am so tired of you!

00:23:57.620 --> 00:24:01.000
Come, IV! I'll let you meet your friends at hell!

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:03.290
Next on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II:

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:05.960
Farewell, My Friend... Feelings Fallen into the Void!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:09.130
This my destiny as a Barian bastard...
